---
description: IR with a title, an accessible title and a multi-line accessible description; v12 stores the title and never draws it.
---
railroad-beta
title Signed numbers
accTitle:   A signed integer
accDescr {
  An optional sign,
     then one or more digits.
}
number = sequence(optional(choice(terminal("+"), terminal("-"))), oneOrMore(nonterminal("digit"))) ;
digit = choice(terminal("0"), terminal("1"), terminal("2")) ;
